    "title": "Former New Mexico Police Chief guilty, Sunport observation deck, Storm approaches, Emergency petition, Old Gumby's Store - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Isaac Cruz ,\n1 days ago [1] Former New Mexico Police Chief found guilty – A now-former New Mexico police chief was found guilty of impersonating an officer after he pulled over a driver outside his jurisdiction. Then-Loving Police Chief Frank Methola pulled over a man in Carlsbad. He told police the driver nearly hit him and another driver. Police lapel video shows a tense back-and-forth with the driver calling the chief out for overstepping his bounds. Methola eventually ran out of patience and tased the man. A jury convicted Methola of impersonating an officer and battery. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
